	// CHARACTER: STRAUSS
	// CONTEXT:Calm
	// DIALOG : I've been working on the data decryption since my rescue, it took me the better part of a day, but I’ve finished the decryption algorithms.
	"lipsync_strauss_workingondata"        "vo_strauss_workingondata"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: STRAUSS
	// CONTEXT:Calm
	// DIALOG : There is so much data, it could take weeks to fully decode, but, as you can see here, we have every available CPU dedicated to the task.
	"lipsync_strauss_somuchdat"        "vo_strauss_somuchdat"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: STRAUSS
	// CONTEXT:Calm
	// DIALOG : That said, some of the decrypted information has already proven useful in outlining our next major offensive against the Nexus.
	"lipsync_strauss_thatsaid"        "vo_strauss_thatsaid"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: STRAUSS
	// CONTEXT:Arrogant
	// DIALOG : I would like to help the decryption effort, but my skills are required for the upcoming Nexus assault, it cannot succeed without my assistance.
	"lipsync_strauss_likehelp"        "vo_strauss_likehelp"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: STRAUSS
	// CONTEXT:Calm
	// DIALOG : I’ve left the decryption algorithms with Sci-tech. Find your Technician, Tak. He is the only one at Sci-Tech with the intellect to finish the work I’ve begun. Good luck.
	"lipsync_strauss_leftdecrypt"        "vo_strauss_leftdecrypt"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: STRAUSS +USE
	// CONTEXT:Informative
	// DIALOG : I've told command time and time again, it's intellect that will win this war
	"lipsync_strauss_itoldcmdint"        "vo_strauss_itoldcmdint"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: STRAUSS +USE
	// CONTEXT:Complementary
	// DIALOG : You should be commended for your skills Sergeant, had I succumbed to the Strogg, this war would be over
	"lipsync_strauss_youshouldcmd"        "vo_strauss_youshouldcmd"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: STRAUSS +USE
	// CONTEXT:Calm
	// DIALOG : I'm waiting on the rest of Rhino squad for our Nexus briefing, it was good to meet you Sergeant Chase
	"lipsync_strauss_waitingrh"        "vo_strauss_waitingrh"

		
	
	// CHARACTER: TAK
	// CONTEXT:Prodding
	// DIALOG : Dekard, I need you in Sci-tech
	"lipsync_tak_dekinsci"        "vo_tak_dekinsci"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: TAK
	// CONTEXT:Prodding
	// DIALOG : Hey Dekard, when you get a chance, stop by Sci-tech
	"lipsync_tak_heydekwhenyou"        "vo_tak_heydekwhenyou"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: TAK
	// CONTEXT:Prodding
	// DIALOG : Dekard, you're going to want to see the data we've uncovered here in Sci-tech
	"lipsync_tak_dekyougoing"        "vo_tak_dekyougoing"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: TAK
	// CONTEXT:Informative
	// DIALOG : Dekard, we've been pouring over the data since Strauss provided the decryption algorithms, and we've come across something really disturbing...
	"lipsync_tak_dekwepouringover"        "vo_tak_dekwepouringover"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: TAK
	// CONTEXT:Informative, Intrigued
	// DIALOG : There are a number of references to the Makron, or Makrons, we aren't sure, but more importantly, there is talk of some kind of Makron Guardian, the Strogg refer to it as the Valkaryne.
	"lipsync_tak_numrefvalk"        "vo_tak_numrefvalk"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: TAK
	// CONTEXT:Informative
	// DIALOG : We're minutes away from fully decoding this sequence, once that is complete we will...
	"lipsync_tak_wemins"        "vo_tak_wemins"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: TAK
	// CONTEXT:Surprised
	// DIALOG : What the hell is going on?!
	"lipsync_tak_whathellgo"        "vo_tak_whathellgo"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: TAK
	// CONTEXT:Tense, hurried
	// DIALOG : We finished decoding the data about the Makron guardian, AKA the Valkaryne?  She is the reason why another Makron appeared so quickly after the first one fell.  Her entire purpose is to awaken a new Makron when one is destroyed.  
	"lipsync_tak_wefindec"        "vo_tak_wefindec"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: TAK
	// CONTEXT:Informative, hurried
	// DIALOG : The Valkaryne acts as a data conduit for a newly awakened Makron.  She filters all the data from the Nexus into a new Makron, making sure the Strogg leadership doesn't skip a beat.  This is even more concerning- since she can filter Nexus information directly, it's possible she doesn't need the Nexus like the other Strogg do.  She can function without it!
	"lipsync_tak_valkact"        "vo_tak_valkact"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: TAK
	// CONTEXT:Informative, hurried
	// DIALOG : The data we found  pointed us to a cryogenic facility where perhaps hundreds of Makrons are stored in stasis, if the Nexus assault is successful - the Valkaryne will just awaken another Makron immediately and we'll be back to square one.
	"lipsync_tak_datapoint"        "vo_tak_datapoint"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: TAK
	// CONTEXT:Tense, hurried
	// DIALOG : Unfortunately, the Strogg have already begun to shut down access lines to the Cryogenics facility, like a preemptive action in case they detect that the Makron is danger.  Locking mechanisms are shutting down as we speak.
	"lipsync_tak_unfortstrgg"        "vo_tak_unfortstrgg"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: TAK +USE
	// CONTEXT:Hurried, Tense
	// DIALOG : Dekard, get to a perimeter defense gun!
	"lipsync_tak_dekperi"        "vo_tak_dekperi"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: TAK +USE
	// CONTEXT:Hurried, Tense
	// DIALOG : I need to stay here and get this data decoded!
	"lipsync_tak_ineedtostay"        "vo_tak_ineedtostay"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: TAK +USE
	// CONTEXT:Hurried, Tense
	// DIALOG : Sorry Dekard, I need to focus on this data!
	"lipsync_tak_sorrydekn"        "vo_tak_sorrydekn"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: TAK +USE
	// CONTEXT:Distant
	// DIALOG : Hundreds of Makrons...We've got to succeed
	"lipsync_tak_hundredsmak"        "vo_tak_hundredsmak"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: TAK +USE
	// CONTEXT:Tense
	// DIALOG : Let's go Dekard.
	"lipsync_tak_letsgodek"        "vo_tak_letsgodek"
	
	
	// CHARACTER: TAK +USE
	// CONTEXT:Tense
	// DIALOG : The route to the Cryogenics facility is closing as we speak, we have to go!
	"lipsync_tak_routtocryo"        "vo_tak_routtocryo"

		
	
